msgid ""
"`SmartAP PDB <https://sky-drones.com/power/smartap-pdb.html>`__ (Power "
"Distribution Board) is a board which allows transferring the power from the "
"battery to ESCs / Motors and generate power supply for the autopilot and "
"other peripherals with different voltage levels. Also, PDB provides the "
"functionality for battery voltage / current measurements. SmartAP PDB makes "
"high-power lines connections easier and much more reliable."
msgstr ""
"`SmartAP PDB <https://sky-drones.com/power/smartap-pdb.html>`__ "
"（电源分配板）是一种将电池电能分配给 ESC/电机，并为飞控和其他外设提供不同电压等级电源的板卡。同时，PDB "
"还提供电池电压/电流测量功能。SmartAP PDB 使大电流线路的连接更加简便可靠。"

