msgid ""
"SmartAP Power Distribution Board pinout diagram is shown below. Big pads in "
"the rear side are intended for the main battery connection. Up to four "
"independent batteries can be connected using the thick wires (e.g. 8-10 AWG)"
" to be able to handle high current loads and even more using thinner wires. "
"Both top and bottom, left and right sides have pads for ESCs power supply "
"connection. Therefore, up to 12 ESCs can be connected."
msgstr ""
"SmartAP 电源分配板引脚定义图如下所示。背面的大焊盘用于主电池连接。最多可使用粗线（如8-10 "
"AWG）连接4个独立电池，以承受大电流负载，也可使用更细的线接更多电池。顶部和底部、左侧和右侧均有用于 ESC 电源连接的焊盘，因此最多可连接12个 "
"ESC。"

